From 8b608c1fd7f5057a4439c6cf041695f3996f159d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Otavio Salvador <otavio@ossystems.com.br>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 07:59:53 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 05/11] feat(server): Codex runs one shared process per project

One provider process carries one environment, so sharing a Codex app-server across projects
would give every project the first one's direnv environment. Derive the shared session per
project; threads with a stored session id keep it.
---
